--- tool-index.js ---
@sig 6914dc0c
class ToolIndex|7m|cached registry for child MCP tools with search and tag filters
  .rebuild()|queries every child server tools/list and rebuilds name-to-server map
  .setTags()|loads configured tag-to-tool-name mappings
  .search()|returns tool summaries by tag, server, keyword, or full list
  .get()|returns full tool definition and owning server by name
  .getAvailableTags()|lists configured tag names
  .getServers()|summarizes indexed child servers with tool counts
  .isReady()|reports whether at least one rebuild completed
  CALLS→tools.clear,servers.keys,proxyManager.requestFromChild,tools.set,console.error,tags.clear,Object.entries,tags.set
PATTERNS: rebuild-on-demand cache|summary search results|full definitions via get()
EDGE_CASES: child list failures are logged and skipped|missing tags return empty result
